{"id":14881,"date":"2024-12-12T11:23:58","date_gmt":"2024-12-12T11:23:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/?p=14881"},"modified":"2024-12-19T10:39:23","modified_gmt":"2024-12-19T10:39:23","slug":"devlop-presente-na-nexus-international-conference-dgtmp2024","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/devlop-presente-na-nexus-international-conference-dgtmp2024\/","title":{"rendered":"Devlop Presente na NEXUS International Conference: DGTMP2024"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"14881\" class=\"elementor elementor-14881\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b0f266b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b0f266b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c5683d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3c5683d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<h4><span data-teams=\"true\">A Devlop na Vanguarda da Transforma\u00e7\u00e3o Digital e Verde no Setor Log\u00edstico<\/span><\/h4><p><span data-teams=\"true\">A Devlop, como organza\u00e7\u00e3o integrante na <a href=\"https:\/\/nexuslab.pt\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agenda Nexus<\/a> e empresa l\u00edder em solu\u00e7\u00f5es tecnol\u00f3gicas para log\u00edstica e transportes, marcou presen\u00e7a no evento NEXUS International Conference: DGTMP2024, realizado em Sines e organizado pela APS (Administra\u00e7\u00e3o dos Portos de Sines e do Algarve). <\/span><\/p><p><span data-teams=\"true\">Este encontro, centrou-se no tema &#8220;Digital and Green Transition in Maritime Ports: Trends and Challenges&#8221;, reunindo especialistas internacionais para debater os avan\u00e7os e desafios na log\u00edstica digital e mobilidade sustent\u00e1vel em portos mar\u00edtimos.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-357bd40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"357bd40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}.e-con{--container-widget-width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer{width:var(--container-widget-width,var(--spacer-size));--align-self:var(--container-widget-align-self,initial);--flex-shrink:0}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container{height:100%;width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer{height:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--container-widget-height,var(--spacer-size))}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty{position:relative;min-height:22px;min-width:22px}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;margin:auto;padding:0;width:22px;height:22px}<\/style>\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5283e5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e5283e5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7af8cb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7af8cb9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><span data-teams=\"true\">Um Marco na Inova\u00e7\u00e3o Portu\u00e1ria<\/span><\/h4><p>A confer\u00eancia explorou as mais recentes tecnologias e estrat\u00e9gias que est\u00e3o a revolucionar a gest\u00e3o e opera\u00e7\u00e3o dos portos. Foram abordados temas cruciais como:<\/p><ul><li>Automa\u00e7\u00e3o portu\u00e1ria e sistemas inteligentes<\/li><li>Solu\u00e7\u00f5es de energia verde para infraestruturas portu\u00e1rias<\/li><li>Digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o das cadeias de abastecimento mar\u00edtimas<\/li><li>Desafios na implementa\u00e7\u00e3o de tecnologias emergentes<\/li><\/ul><p>A participa\u00e7\u00e3o da Devlop neste evento reafirma o seu compromisso com a inova\u00e7\u00e3o e sustentabilidade no setor log\u00edstico, alinhando-se com as mais recentes tend\u00eancias globais.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11bcf71 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"11bcf71\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99fb022 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"99fb022\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b39dda4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b39dda4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><span data-teams=\"true\">O Papel da Devlop na Agenda Nexus<\/span><\/h4><p><span data-teams=\"true\">A Devlop n\u00e3o \u00e9 apenas uma participante, mas uma protagonista ativa na Agenda Nexus. <\/span><\/p><p><span data-teams=\"true\">Como uma das organiza\u00e7\u00f5es-chave, a empresa tem um papel destacado no desenvolvimento de produtos inovadores no \u00e2mbito do <a href=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/agenda-nexus\/\">Nexus Smart Logistics (WP5)<\/a>. <\/span><\/p><p><span data-teams=\"true\">Este envolvimento traduz-se em:<\/span><\/p><h6><b>WEBTRANS<\/b><\/h6><p>\u00a0\u00c9 uma estrutura inovadora de Gest\u00e3o de Transportes LowCode\\NoCode para construir aplica\u00e7\u00f5es cloud que ser\u00e3o integradas com NEXUS, e gerir nativamente o eBL, eCMR e todos os documentos eFreight. Ser\u00e1 especialmente concebido para tirar o m\u00e1ximo partido de todo o contexto colaborativo de dados abertos do NEXUS.<\/p><h6><b>3D Smart Depot Panel<\/b><\/h6><p>\u00c9 uma Ferramenta de Planeamento e Visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o inteligente de Empilhamento de Contentores para Dep\u00f3sitos com uma inovadora UI\/UX. \u00c9 apresentado como um suplemento aos sistemas TMS ou TOS, com interfaces que permitem a leitura da informa\u00e7\u00e3o em tempo real do estado terminal do dep\u00f3sito e que permitam fazer movimentos de \u201carrastar e largar\u201d no dep\u00f3sito e terminal atrav\u00e9s de um painel gr\u00e1fico, muito \u00fatil tanto para a opera\u00e7\u00e3o no terreno como para aqueles que fazem a gest\u00e3o di\u00e1ria do dep\u00f3sito.<\/p><h6>\u00a0<b>eBL<\/b><\/h6><p>Plataforma NEXUS interoper\u00e1vel de cadeia de bloqueio para desmaterializa\u00e7\u00e3o de documentos de conhecimento de embarque utilizando tecnologia de cadeia de bloqueio seguindo as normas de com\u00e9rcio internacional.<\/p><h6><b>eCMR<\/b><\/h6><p>\u00a0Plataforma a ser utilizada para desmaterializa\u00e7\u00e3o de documentos CMR utilizando tecnologia de cadeia de blocos, que pode ser ligada a outras solu\u00e7\u00f5es eCMR (n\u00e3o baseadas em cadeia de blocos). Conceber e desenvolver a solu\u00e7\u00e3o Nexus eCMR blockchain e implementar o piloto utilizando a estrutura Nexus, com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o da Nexus Partners Network para demonstrar a sua utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o pr\u00e1tica entre todas as partes envolvidas.<\/p><h6><b>SHoT \u2013 Shiping on Time<\/b><\/h6><p>\u00a0Solu\u00e7\u00e3o inovadora para a reserva e gest\u00e3o do transporte de contentores em terra entre o expedidor e o porto (exporta\u00e7\u00e3o) e o porto e o destinat\u00e1rio (importa\u00e7\u00e3o), dando visibilidade a toda a rede NEXUS (onde e quando o contentor se encontra). Integra\u00e7\u00e3o com a tecnologia Meight para optimizar o encaminhamento e a experi\u00eancia de condu\u00e7\u00e3o.\u00a0<\/p><h6><b>Shipperform<\/b><\/h6><p>\u00a0Uma plataforma de expedidores para contrata\u00e7\u00e3o de transporte multimodal de contentores de carga permitindo a licita\u00e7\u00e3o e reserva para transporte mar\u00edtimo, cami\u00f5es e ferrovi\u00e1rio.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e7a6a2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1e7a6a2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c106fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"0c106fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f901d0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f901d0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A participa\u00e7\u00e3o ativa da Devlop na NEXUS International Conference e o seu papel de na Agenda Nexus demonstram o compromisso da empresa em liderar a transforma\u00e7\u00e3o digital e verde no setor log\u00edstico.\u00a0<\/p><p>Atrav\u00e9s do desenvolvimento de solu\u00e7\u00f5es inovadoras e da colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com parceiros estrat\u00e9gicos, a Devlop est\u00e1 a moldar o futuro da log\u00edstica, promovendo efici\u00eancia, sustentabilidade e competitividade no setor.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00af709 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"00af709\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85e5b74 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"85e5b74\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c90581 elementor-skin-carousel elementor-arrows-yes elementor-pagination-type-bullets elementor-pagination-position-outside elementor-widget elementor-widget-media-carousel\" data-id=\"3c90581\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;space_between&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:8,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;skin&quot;:&quot;carousel&quot;,&quot;effect&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;show_arrows&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pagination&quot;:&quot;bullets&quot;,&quot;